# werkfab
===
 WerkFab – free, open-source CAD/CAM that runs offline in the browser or as a Windows app: parametric 3D design, drawings, CNC milling and turning toolpaths, simulation and post processors (Heidenhain, Fanuc, Sinumerik, Okuma, LinuxCNC, GRBL)..
